{"id":2404,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>2025年11月4日下午，机械工程学院在图书馆五层学术报告厅举办题为“知识，智慧与真理”的中北大讲堂，特邀北京大学哲学系中国哲学教研室主任、博士生导师郑开教授主讲。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=hM8l3inm7bnllDnBmQ2M8WRn7QRL49GYL4MkozW7nR6kL8l0gihFp2hmCIa0Mky8U1h2L1y4nzNYMRLiolLaolL4LNWkLznRnNVVMR78MmTFn7MkLRC8M4MFozGbLYb/v2veo4OeqjAbQ2PjCYhXptQ0g478L490LmNbozvJqdfnx&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=29997&e=.jpg\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/44BF23E924359C09C32BB14CFAE41469/DCB06473/9093\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 516px\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=hM8l3inm7bnllDnBmQ2M8WRn7QRL49GYL4MkozW7nR6kL8l0gihFp2hmCIa0Mky8U1h2L1y4nzNYMRLiolLaolL4LNWkLznRnNVVMR78MmTFn7MkLRC8M4MFozGbLYb/v2veo4OeqjAbQ2PjCYhXptQ0g478L490LmNbozvJqdfnx&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=29997&e=.jpg\"></p><p>郑教授以“什么是知识，如何探寻智慧、何以讨论真理？”开篇，带领同学们进入哲学的“众妙之门”，随后引用《论语》《中庸》《孟子》《周易》等经典著作的内容，通俗拆解儒家“转识成智”的路径，让大家领悟从真诚求知到明心见性的过程。随后，郑教授对比中西哲学范式，提出“感性、理性、觉性”知识三分法，结合“庄周梦蝶”阐释“天人合一”的多元真理观，引导同学们通过反思已有知识，探寻更高一层次的智慧与觉悟。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=hLmW37L8r7Lz94UBzrVLlVfnz7YnlUGDnmNbL47DUm7aM8L0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yZLkhfnkh2L8QVU4G4LzNaL7UZnNMfMNV2L4LPMR9YMzTFUN-8nlCPo7QFLzUDLlUJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4-bozNsgtA8pUfcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=29997&e=.jpg\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/B80ADF3FEC031900D8FCA6AF33148259/BB4EF18F/1461D\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 516px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=hLmW37L8r7Lz94UBzrVLlVfnz7YnlUGDnmNbL47DUm7aM8L0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yZLkhfnkh2L8QVU4G4LzNaL7UZnNMfMNV2L4LPMR9YMzTFUN-8nlCPo7QFLzUDLlUJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4-bozNsgtA8pUfcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=29997&e=.jpg\"></p><p>整场讲座中，郑教授把深奥的哲学典籍巧妙转化为贴近生活的通俗道理。他引领同学们在反思人类知识体系的进程中，唤醒对智慧的感知，逐步体悟从知识迈向觉悟的进阶之路，让每一位同学都能真切感受到哲学的温度与力量。</p><p>一审一校/管玲钰</p><p>二审二校/孟 &nbsp; 飞</p><p>三审三校/刘晨华</p><p><br></p></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jxdl.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=hM8l3inm7bnllDnBmQ2M8WRn7QRL49GYL4MkozW7nR6kL8l0gihFp2hmCIa0Mky8U1h2L1y4nzNYMRLiolLaolL4LNWkLznRnNVVMR78MmTFn7MkLRC8M4MFozGbLYb/v2veo4OeqjAbQ2PjCYhXptQ0g478L490LmNbozvJqdfnx&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=29997&e=.jpg"}